From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sr-0w <Sr-0w@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 14:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: hotdog: match stock camera rail votes

The stock hotdog tree includes sm8150-regulator.dtsi, where PM8009 ldo1,
ldo3 and ldo4 are plain VRM resources without an initial operating mode. The
camera consumers then request 1.104 V from ldo1 and 1.056 V from ldo3/ldo4.

The earlier mainline description instead copied the wider constraints and LPM
capability of sdmmagpie's PM8009 and forced all three rails into HPM. That is
not the regulator contract used by the hotdog firmware and is the last common
difference between these three rails and the stock description. Enabling any
one of them currently causes a PMIC-level reset.

Use the exact per-camera voltages and leave the operating mode untouched, as
the stock SM8150 description does. Keep the parent supplies absent: the stock
RPMh nodes do not describe them either.

Signed-off-by: Sr-0w <Sr-0w@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-common.dtsi | 15 ++++++---------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-common.dtsi
@@ -398,26 +398,23 @@
 		vdd-l5-l6-supply = <&vreg_bob>;
 
 		vreg_l1f_1p1: ldo1 {
-			regulator-min-microvolt = <1100000>;
-			regulator-max-microvolt = <1304000>;
-			regulator-initial-mode = <RPMH_REGULATOR_MODE_HPM>;
+			regulator-min-microvolt = <1104000>;
+			regulator-max-microvolt = <1104000>;
 		};
 
 		vreg_l2f_1p2: ldo2 {
 			regulator-min-microvolt = <1200000>;
 			regulator-max-microvolt = <1200000>;
 			regulator-initial-mode = <RPMH_REGULATOR_MODE_HPM>;
 		};
 
 		vreg_l3f_1p05: ldo3 {
-			regulator-min-microvolt = <1096000>;
-			regulator-max-microvolt = <1304000>;
-			regulator-initial-mode = <RPMH_REGULATOR_MODE_HPM>;
+			regulator-min-microvolt = <1056000>;
+			regulator-max-microvolt = <1056000>;
 		};
 
 		vreg_l4f_1p05: ldo4 {
-			regulator-min-microvolt = <1096000>;
-			regulator-max-microvolt = <1304000>;
-			regulator-initial-mode = <RPMH_REGULATOR_MODE_HPM>;
+			regulator-min-microvolt = <1056000>;
+			regulator-max-microvolt = <1056000>;
 		};
 
 		vreg_l5f_2p85: ldo5 {
